Build only ICU4X's bakeddata and codegen tools. bakeddata reads local source
data (ICU4X_CLDR_DIR, ICU4X_ICUEXPORT_DIR, ICU4X_UNICODE_DIR) instead of
downloading it. (ICU4X 2.4 builds its code point tries in Rust, and its codegen
no longer needs compiled data.)

